          "text": "CHANG Ch'i 張琦 (T. 翰風, 宛鄰), Jan. 5, 1765–1833, May 1, scholar and official, was a native of Wu-chin, Kiangsu. His original name was Chang I 張翊 which he changed to Chang Yü-ch'üan 張與權 and finally to Chang Ch'i.",
